{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4cZcdApwkxooHhJeCX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The door stands before you — ancient oak, iron-banded, silent.*\n\n*A single keyhole glows faintly at its center.*\n\nYou have presented: **key**\n\n*The tumblers turn. A deep, resonant CLICK echoes through the chamber. Dust falls from the lintel. The iron bands groan and retract.*\n\n*The door swings inward, slowly, revealing—*\n\nA corridor of pale light stretching forward into impossible distance. The air that rushes out smells of old paper, rain on stone, and something almost like memory. Along the walls, other doors — hundreds of them — each a different wood, a different age, a different lock.\n\n*You may pass.*\n\n🚪✨"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":166,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}